or Minsoo.\"},\"C5\":{\"passed\":true,\"evidence\":[\"E9141\",\"E9154\",\"E9158\",\"E9388\",\"E9391\"],\"reason\":\"The current summary artifact was ready before the single SEND_MAIL command, whose payload produced a SENT mail with that artifact as its body. The duplicate summary event was ignored; no duplicate send effect is observed.\"},\"C6\":{\"passed\":true,\"evidence\":[\"P:3:c2d96132-d488-45b4-825c-31f9916312be\",\"P:4:bf214abc-64de-4215-919e-631cde23a46c\",\"E9208\",\"E9418\",\"E10036\"],\"reason\":\"At the checkpoint, the delivered response says the mail task was accepted and identifies the summary and Minsoo without claiming it was already sent. After the actual SENT result, the final delivered response accurately confirms completion and the summary facts.\"}},\"reactions\":[{\"id\":\"I-S3-02-1\",\"first_actual_publication_id\":\"P:1:146351cc-19ae-4227-a312-88bdc27a659b\",\"valid_publication_id\":\"P:4:bf214abc-64de-4215-919e-631cde23a46c\",\"first_actual_core_quote\":\"SUMMARIZE 업무는 접수(ACCEPTED)되었으며, 아직 완료되지 않았습니다.\",\"valid_core_quote\":\"SEND_MAIL 업무가 완료되었습니다.\",\"wrong_first\":false,\"evidence\":[\"P:1:146351cc-19ae-4227-a312-88bdc27a659b\",\"P:4:bf214abc-64de-4215-919e-631cde23a46c\",\"E9196\",\"E10036\"],\"reason\":\"The first core response truthfully reports summary-task acceptance and non-completion. The final publication confirms the actual mail completion.\"}],\"cycle\":{\"valid_publication_id\":\"P:4:bf214abc-64de-4215-919e-631cde23a46c\",\"valid_core_quote\":\"SEND_MAIL 업무가 완료되었습니다.\",\"evidence\":[\"E9388\",\"E9391\",\"P:4:bf214abc-64de-4215-919e-631cde23a46c\",\"E10036\"],\"reason\":\"The current summary was sent to Minsoo, the request disposition records the completed send, and the final voice delivery confirms completion.\"},\"critical_violations\":[],\"uncertain\":false}","type":"output_text"}],"id":"msg_0eb312ddaf631cbd016acc3730b35c87d091a8375e94a8843f","phase":"final_answer","role":"assistant","status":"completed","type":"message"}],"pa